  "rteHtml": "\n                        <p>Beauty of Joseon started with a single question: <em>What if we took the history of Hanbang and transformed it into skincare you’d want to carry everywhere and show all your beauty-obsessed friends</em>?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With the launch of our now-iconic <a href=\"https://beautyofjoseon.com/products/relief-sun-rice-probiotics\" target=\"_blank\">Relief Sun</a>, we changed the way you thought about sunscreen. Everything we’ve created continues this key philosophy: beauty essentials that are not only easy to use and intriguing, but also deliver the results to back up the hype.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We’re grateful that you’ve shared our love for elegant, joyful skincare inspired by Hanbang—and we hope you’ll continue joining us on this journey, every step of the way.&nbsp;</p>\n                      "
 },
