  "rteHtml": "\n                  <p>Hanbang is traditional Korean medicine based on natural ingredients with therapeutic properties, a historical practice that remains widely known and used in Korea today.</p><p>Our Hanbang-infused skincare combines these time-honored herbs with lab-backed, clinically effective ingredients.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Developed from the historical teachings recorded in the <em>Gyuhap Chongseo</em>, a Joseon-era encyclopedia written by female scholar Yi Bingheogak. Consciously created to care for all skin types.&nbsp;</p>\n                "
